<title>Somalia: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/somalia/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-somalia-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Somalia's Supreme Court has declared President Hassan Sheikh Mohamud's term extension unlawful, creating political uncertainty while al-Shabaab continues attacks, including a suspected assault on a police station and camp in Garissa and a warning that Houthi support could boost its capabilities. Ugandan troops are withdrawing from Somalia, with peacekeepers repositioning near the capital as the withdrawal proceeds. The United States has vacated the Baledogle airfield after more than a decade of use, and Turkey is reported to be considering taking over the now-empty facility. The conflict caused 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiW0FVX3lxTE1SVFpORU5zQkRLVkp2OWNJWGplQWhXeFE5NkN4UXpOSGtzaVZNUzBfRXZ5cUxKMDliWGZ6a2I3bVMyRko4MlphZmpPdXgyVnRRcHlwdF96ZmxLems?oc=5&quot;&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hiiraan Online&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC News - Breaking News, Latest News and Videos&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPbElHVkdzRG14VExlSGhLTTNtMm1kRk9aXzQyVDBBWmdKSXRxdEFodFJxcGxUTl9fMjB4MEZ1YXhSZG5YZlJVUFEwajE0WFNUVjF2clJpb3otWGVTbzBNY1JRZ2RST3Nqa3BkamNDZWU1QWxMOHB1SXhNT1ZoZldfakJVRHhlRzNNRE1hUVpkSWJnT2h2Vkc4QlRZVzFMYVlnOUt0aE5Sc0N2N0VTQlI0cExSajg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali National News Agency&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimAFBVV95cUxQRVotWTZUUTBaUjRvYV91WUhZdGp4dUV2c0J1Q3FWRldHVDFlOGZYSlUyVDR3YlVMdjNVSHdfU3Q1MlN6eU5GOUxkelh6X1ZDbC0zSTc4WWc4SnhfM2toLUZsaVZ0S3lBREZRSmRNTnFaWXVTWHlMOE1kRVczTkxjT0JjMzJESjNSdFdoNWZPV2JzcEdCaE9UTA?oc=5&quot;&gt;Daily Monitor&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNQzRTTFlYakw2WUUybFk0OWdoMzVxbHR3ckFLbVVnb21DRmJOe